{"about_the_game":"The city is your playground! Nothing will stop you on your freestyle trials bike. Use the urban landscape to pull spectacular tricks - backflips, 360s, wallrides, ollies, and more.<br><br>Customize your bike to boost your performance in Time Attack or Stunt mode. Choose between speed and style, developing your own unique riding style.<br>Challenge the best riders in Ghost Mode.<br><br>The variety and elaborate design of the different backdrops will keep you coming back for hours on end, to achieve a perfect run and knock the top riders off the leaderboard.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Key Features</h2><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>\tImpressive levels set in 5 unique environments<br></li><li>\tVarious game modes: Stunt, Time Attack, Challenges<br></li><li>\tBike and rider customization<br></li><li>\tAdvanced physics &amp; dynamic animations<br></li><li>\tMore than 140 online leaderboards &amp; Ghost mode</li></ul>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"It's a lifestyle","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/243450/e6287eb1b8439d25d4510344c2479d104f92f0ae.jpg"},{"name":"Rough 'n' tough","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/243450/010527e1f431478746c85a068ac090ab49e7db29.jpg"},{"name":"Twist again","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/243450/425eeb2f2980cc1861953bccee6a99d791e15c4e.jpg"},{"name":"Rise to the Challenge","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/243450/b7faa7dc5a4517d061617b4a288753dc9a7ab803.jpg"},{"name":"Streets paved with gold","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/243450/b4da5ccf86f5f7206c63e6d332f67767fd5a5262.jpg"},{"name":"Piece of cake","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/243450/4568f115c90ed7765e89ca4968990f744408a770.jpg"},{"name":"Free Spirit","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/p